00:30:49.640 --> 00:30:57.000
And what I mean by that is all of your – you need to do a ton of homework on your – you should do your homework on everything in Web3, don't get me wrong.

416
00:30:57.320 --> 00:30:59.720
But you should look at, you know, are these protocols audited?

