00:31:00.000 --> 00:31:08.400
Many of the protocols on Core have two audits from, you know, amazing firms like Halborn, et cetera, and, like, have, you know, quite a bit of DD that's done into these.

418
00:31:08.480 --> 00:31:15.840
But you yourself as a user should always check into those to make sure that you're, again, going to something that you would trust with your own funds.

419
00:31:15.840 --> 00:31:20.160
But when you're in the EVM ecosystem, you can do so many more things besides just staking.

