502
00:36:59.260 --> 00:37:02.660
And this is how we blend these two groups over time.

503
00:37:02.940 --> 00:37:06.380
And the whole idea behind Core is Bitcoin alignment, right?

504
00:37:06.400 --> 00:37:08.160
It's the merging of these two communities.

505
00:37:08.500 --> 00:37:11.360
And this is kind of a walk in the crawl, walk, run.

506
00:37:11.360 --> 00:37:22.020
And if you think about, like, kind of going back to the spectrum of, you know, Bitcoin, putting your Bitcoin to work spectrum, if you will, you have Bitcoin.

