00:41:09.580 --> 00:41:13.360
And we do believe that this is a community-run project and always will be.

564
00:41:13.900 --> 00:41:21.960
And that is just, it amplifies the potential of what this can be, not just on like an economic level, but also like a social, political, et cetera level.

