586
00:43:01.440 --> 00:43:05.440
And for so much of crypto, for so long, it's been if you build it, they will come, right?

587
00:43:05.480 --> 00:43:10.280
It's been this, like, you know, let me pontificate kind of the future of finance to you and whatever.

